ull,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Hello 大家好呀，\n\n我们在 03.03 号正式上线了官方中文社区 👉 **https://forum.trae.cn/**\n\n为了信息更聚焦，解决方案可以沉淀并方便查询，欢迎大家后续提问直接在【官方社区】-「帮助与支持」板块发起，社群伙伴和官方技术支持会更快响应！\n**【帮助与支持板块】👉 https://forum.trae.cn/c/7-category/7**\n\n⚠️⚠️ ⚠️ ⚠️ ⚠️ ⚠️  Github Issues 板块从今日起将不再回复问题，所有问题请到 👉 官方社区发起。感谢支持！\n\n=================\n官方网站\n1️⃣ CN 版官网：https://www.trae.cn/\n2️⃣ 国际版官网：https://www.trae.ai/\n\n官方文档站\n1️⃣ CN 版：https://docs.trae.cn/ide/troubleshooting\n2️⃣ 国际版：https://docs.trae.ai/ide/troubleshooting?_lang=zh\n\n官方海外社区：\n1️⃣ 官方Discord 社区：https://discord.gg/khgsMs6zQg\n2️⃣ 官方Reddit 社区：https://www.reddit.com/r/Trae_ai/\n3️⃣ 官方X 主页：https://x.com/Trae_ai\n4️⃣ 官方微信账号：TRAE.ai\n\n涉及到退款申请，直接发送邮件到邮箱：[feedback@mail.trae.ai](mailto:feedback@mail.trae.ai)\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2348/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":0,"-1":4,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2348/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null},"comments":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/4152780204","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2348#issuecomment-4152780204","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2348","id":4152780204,"node_id":"IC_kwDONiYvnc73hmWs","user":{"login":"Jessica-ppp","id":229125699,"node_id":"U_kgDODaguQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/229125699?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jessica-ppp","html_url":"https://github.com/Jessica-ppp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jessica-ppp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jessica-ppp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jessica-ppp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jessica-ppp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jessica-ppp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jessica-ppp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jessica-ppp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jessica-ppp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jessica-ppp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-30T07:11:20Z","updated_at":"2026-03-30T07:11:20Z","body":"统一给大家回复下开通社区的原因：\n官方社区会集中回复大家的问题，也欢迎大家在官方的社区渠道反馈问题，大家想发表任何意见都可以发布\n统一到官方社区发帖，一方面是官方的回复更快速，不用分散在各类渠道，保障了我们的及时性，一方面也是共性的问题方便大家查找","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/4152780204/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/4200337344","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2348#issuecomment-4200337344","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2348","id":4200337344,"node_id":"IC_kwDONiYvnc76XA_A","user":{"login":"codecli777","id":231147879,"node_id":"U_kgDODccJZw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/231147879?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/codecli777","html_url":"https://github.com/codecli777","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codecli777/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codecli777/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codecli777/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codecli777/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codecli777/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codecli777/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codecli777/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codecli777/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codecli777/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-07T15:48:00Z","updated_at":"2026-04-07T15:48:00Z","body":"> 统一给大家回复下开通社区的原因： 官方社区会集中回复大家的问题，也欢迎大家在官方的社区渠道反馈问题，大家想发表任何意见都可以发布 统一到官方社区发帖，一方面是官方的回复更快速，不用分散在各类渠道，保障了我们的及时性，一方面也是共性的问题方便大家查找\n\n给些建议，你看是否比较合理一些：\n1.这边依然维护，但是周期可以久一些，哪怕3-7天\n2.问题的回复指向官方社区，并且对于常见问题出专题回复\n3.公告6个月或1年后这边不再维护，中途可以逐步延长回复周期，可以实现软着陆\n4.官方社区训练豆包作为常见问题处理客服\n\n如果实在不想维护，现在就要提前公告，比如保不准什么时候这边仓库就迁移或关闭了，最好给用户3个月缓冲期","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/4200337344/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/4474042540","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2348#issuecomment-4474042540","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2348","id":4474042540,"node_id":"IC_kwDONiYvnc8AAAABCqx4rA","user":{"login":"CatcherOne","id":34915019,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTE1MDE5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34915019?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CatcherOne","html_url":"https://github.com/CatcherOne","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CatcherOne/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CatcherOne/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CatcherOne/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CatcherOne/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CatcherOne/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CatcherOne/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CatcherOne/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CatcherOne/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CatcherOne/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-18T03:36:57Z","updated_at":"2026-05-18T03:36:57Z","body":"想咨询一下退款信息\n因为我的支付显示，4.26有一笔月会员开启，然后5月7号开启年度会员。按理说5月份用的额度应该是月度会员的额度，年会员额度是没有用的，但年度会员额度的退费还是扣了一个月的\n商家订单号：2026042519074101000320048177111是月度会员\n商家订单号：2026050819074101000030056361463是年度会员\n社区无法登录，只能在这里了","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/4474042540/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]}